{
  "slug": "gooseworks",
  "name": "Gooseworks",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "GooseWorks gives your coding agent access to 100+ data skills for GTM, sales, and research tasks. Search and scrape Twitter/X, Reddit, LinkedIn, and the web. Find people, emails, and\ncompany info. Enrich contacts, research competitors, build lead lists, and run outbound campaigns — without leaving your coding agent.\n\nSkills are organized into capabilities (atomic tools), composites (multi-step chains), and playbooks (end-to-end workflows) covering lead generation, outreach, competitive\nintelligence, SEO, content, ads, and monitoring.\n\nGooseWorks also includes an API gateway to 300+ data APIs (Hunter, Apollo, Clearbit, PDL, and more) — all accessible through a single API key with pay-per-use credit billing.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `goose-ads` (GooseWorks ads skill — create, edit, AND analyze ad creative), `goose-video` (GooseWorks video ads — remix a video ad template (iMessage chat-reveal, more coming) into a branded video ad…), `gooseworks` (GooseWorks data toolkit)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gooseworks@claude-community` from `gooseworks-ai/gooseworks`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
